  "id": "willpower",
  "term": "willpower",
  "definition": "Willpower is the belief that one has the determination and motivational strength to keep pursuing a goal despite obstacles. In psychology, it refers to the inner drive, persistence, and sense of personal capability that help sustain effort toward valued aims even when setbacks or uncertainty arise.",
